# Per-run archives — seeded projects, event JSONL, grades, transcripts — are
# ordinary CI artifacts, not repository history, so everything inside a
# `<model>/<date>/` run directory is ignored by default.
#
# Two things are deliberately trackable:
#   * `<model>/<date>.json` — the scoring artifact verification.md names as the
#     leaderboard row (the rules below never match it: it sits one level up);
#   * `<model>/<date>/runs.jsonl` — the RunRecord index `heph bench score`
#     reads, small enough to keep and the only way to re-derive a score.
#
# The run directory itself is left un-ignored on purpose: git cannot re-include
# a path whose parent directory is excluded, so the exclusion starts one level
# deeper.
*/*/*
!*/*/runs.jsonl
